{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:48 2026-08-11 HKT</p>\n\n<p>慈雲山沙田坳道400號近觀音廟，今（11日）早上8時13分，有晨運客在該處對上100米山坡，發現一名年約30歲男子，在離地4米高樹椏吊頸自殺，報警求助，消防接報到場將事主解下，經檢驗後證實當場氣絕身亡。警方正調查死者身份及其尋死原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"消防到場解下事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d08d087e1d0122e1ea58f0a7cb4fbd00/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_10_09_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場解下事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/482d1eb6da9e0de6af14d2653b6547bd/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_10_09_14_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/49ba2e6ded33095881d86528a9c355e1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_10_09_14_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場解下事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f4983ef2aad99bb84d1a1604ecdf4a16/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_10_09_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場解下事主。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cbd47845f28090346347469bb810e651/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_10_09_13.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T03:21:21.831354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}